# NOTICE

## Data provenance

The images and ground-truth masks in this repository were not collected by the authors of this repository. They come from 3DOI (*Understanding 3D Object Interaction from a Single Image*, Qian & Fouhey, ICCV 2023), which states that its images were collected from **EpicKitchens** and **Omnidata**; each of those sources keeps its own original license.

The language instructions come from RAGNet (*RAGNet: Large-scale Reasoning-based Affordance Segmentation Benchmark towards General Grasping*, Wu et al., ICCV 2025), generated by GPT-4 from the 3DOI annotations.

The full chain is:

```
EpicKitchens -+
              +--> 3DOI (ICCV 2023) --> 3DOI subset (1,013 items) --> this repository
Omnidata     -+                          instructions provided by RAGNet
```

## Changes made in this repository

Image files, ground-truth masks, splits and sample ids are unchanged.

Only the instruction text is modified: 381 instructions rewritten and 16 items rejected. Each image–instruction pair was read one by one and re-judged for whether its instruction matches its ground-truth mask, with a verdict of keep, edit or reject; all verdicts were re-checked in two passes. The item-by-item record is in `review_log.jsonl`, where `original_question` keeps the instruction before revision, `question` gives this version, and `review_status` gives the final verdict.

